add('6.4.1', True, 'Owner statement received 2026-10-22: Cloudflare is the DNS provider and registrar, and all lastrefuge.ai subdomains point to active services under the owner’s control. Public DNS confirms Cloudflare nameservers barbara.ns.cloudflare.com and clark.ns.cloudflare.com; apex and www resolve to 104.251.123.207. Overlook’s OAuth redirect uses 127.0.0.1, not a company subdomain. Public queries are not a complete DNS-zone export; TAC may request the Cloudflare zone/configuration screenshot to substantiate the full inventory.', [('llm-docs/casa/logs/public-dns.txt','lastrefuge.ai IN NS',17)], 'Owner attestation plus public DNS observation. Registrar ownership and every zone record were not independently verified in Cloudflare.')
add('6.5.1', True, 'OAuth access/refresh tokens, desktop client-secret values and PKCE verifiers have redacted Debug implementations. Both file and stderr logging reject protocol/vault targets even when RUST_LOG requests trace, preventing raw wire-byte credential logs. The sample attached is a synthetic login-credential diagnostic regression, explicitly not a live Google login. Overlook has no payment flow. Local logs can include operational mailbox metadata; no claim is made that all personal data is absent from logs.', [(MAIN,'fn safe_log_metadata',3),(OAUTH,'impl std::fmt::Debug for OAuthTokens',5),('llm-docs/casa/logs/synthetic-login.txt',' INFO overlook::synthetic_login',6)], 'Credential logging regression passed at trace level. TAC may request a controlled live test-account login log; real user credentials/mail were not collected.')
